// The sheet's own mechanic is a pooled/simultaneous instant heal to up to
// six chosen allies -- `BasicAura`'s only healing primitive is
// `AuraKind::Buff(Regeneration)`, a per-second tick over a duration, not a
// lump-sum instant. A `pool_split` (see
// assets/common/abilities/spells/arcane/power_word_fortify.ron) exists for
// capped-nearest-N target selection, but it is tied to that spell's own
// class-level-scaling design (`unlock_level`/`value_at_max_level`/
// `source_classes`) built for a high-circle Power Word, not a generic
// pooled heal -- reusing it here would import scaling knobs this circle-2
// spell has no use for. Approximated instead the same way
// assets/common/abilities/spells/hemomancy/vitalic_font.ron approximates a
// heal via `BasicAura`: a short, strong `Regeneration` tick (duration kept
// brief so the total delivered reads as "at once" rather than a real
// sustain), same simplification the sheet's own notes already flag.
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.6,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: Regeneration,
            strength: 8.0,
            duration: Some(3.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(3.0),
    range: 9.0,
    energy_cost: 55.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: Some(HealingAura),
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Divine)),
)
